<title>JAPAN: Japan February oil product import statistics-MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan February oil product import statistics-MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of International Trade and Industry issued the following data on oil product imports during February.</p>
<p>	(In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%   yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	71	446.6   - 20.8     +446.2</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,164     13,612   -  3.6     + 24.0</p>
<p> Kerosene     575	3,617   -  7.0     - 36.7</p>
<p> Gas oil	 71	  447   + 47.9     - 61.4</p>
<p> Fuel oil A   110	  692   + 37.5     - 19.1</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   188	1,183   -  8.3     - 50.3</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
